{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1773856859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1773856859 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/8dc467068ebe201718948c40ac194e6a.avif?t=1773856859\" width=720 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables is a<strong> narrative driven 3D platformer</strong>, which follows a group of children telling stories around a campfire. These stories then come to life, and you<strong> play through them as your favourite plushie!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be transported across worlds! From a pirate island, to a lush forest, even to outer space - <strong>Anywhere that the children's imaginations can take you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/24d3123a5d6862a0dc23fdee8744a2d2.avif?t=1773856859\" width=720 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1773856859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1773856859 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables will tell a<strong> heartwarming story</strong> about a group of children, who escape into their imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start your journey into each world, you will have time to <strong>sit at the campfire with the other children.</strong> You will be able to learn their thoughts, feelings, loves, fears...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/c8e706fda801afdb3cf63bb994b41009.avif?t=1773856859\" width=720 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of the game, the underlying narrative will begin to show itself. <strong>There is more to these kids than initially seems</strong>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1773856859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1773856859 width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>InkForge Studios </strong>is supporting<strong> Great Ormond Street Hospital Charity (GOSH Charity) </strong>by donating<strong> 25% </strong>of the game\u2019s<strong> Steam revenue!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InkForge Studios Creative Director, <strong>Thomas Hunt</strong>, is a outpatient at GOSH. From the <strong>age of just 2 weeks old</strong>, Tom had to undergo an operation and has been a <strong>patient there ever since</strong>. This was what initially fueled our desire to develop our previous title, 'I'll be Brave, Tomorrow' in partnership with GOSH, and the same is true for 'Fireside Fables'!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Adventure begins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/76a0b0d67b95f2d92c9e948beb8c9f1d4ce21048.jpg"},{"name":"A monkey rescue!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/bcfe3367f16e050e9fb1a657a7b8728ac4edfdfd.jpg"},{"name":"A beached bottle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/111b5da1229747aef5786581f72d8362b5c7937a.jpg"},{"name":"Ahoy, Matey! - Letters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/a88e1c30d39a2e674fbaf9a1b8f1b6ec92f543d2.jpg"},{"name":"A pirates buried treasure!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/f4c28c9b7fa1f267e43ff31e3ca08d16bc694ae9.jpg"},{"name":"Gacha machine - Pirate!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/1f8b4fceb1902457dcb6d4310582dfae2bc2b001.jpg"},{"name":"Atop the flag!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/07fd55c961b9788987250c1ba506c5619dfb0fe9.jpg"},{"name":"On the broken ship!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/c363ece561bb272df730b1e28a0996510a48a357.jpg"},{"name":"Shipwreck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/b73a2a730afba97c16f90932596d7cbd2474cb7b.jpg"},{"name":"Just monkey business!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365560/cc3aecf26060223e33a28cb2041ecae783bbe63c.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365560?t=1773856859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365560?t=1773856859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/39d10cb275c7fea1b55ae83833fd63f0d6b0ce49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773856859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/39d10cb275c7fea1b55ae83833fd63f0d6b0ce49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773856859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4370280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>London Games Festival</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/9d14369511d9011655f5c533bdd09751.avif?t=1773856859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/9d14369511d9011655f5c533bdd09751.avif?t=1773856859 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have been selected to take part in the London Games Festival 2025! Play a demo of Fireside Fables at New Game Plus\u00a0Thursday 3 April &amp; Friday 4 April, and keep an eye out for the Steam event!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1773856859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1773856859 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/8dc467068ebe201718948c40ac194e6a.avif?t=1773856859\" width=720 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables is a<strong> narrative driven 3D platformer</strong>, which follows a group of children telling stories around a campfire. These stories then come to life, and you<strong> play through them as your favourite plushie!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be transported across worlds! From a pirate island, to a lush forest, even to outer space - <strong>Anywhere that the children's imaginations can take you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/24d3123a5d6862a0dc23fdee8744a2d2.avif?t=1773856859\" width=720 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1773856859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1773856859 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables will tell a<strong> heartwarming story</strong> about a group of children, who escape into their imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start your journey into each world, you will have time to <strong>sit at the campfire with the other children.</strong> You will be able to learn their thoughts, feelings, loves, fears...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/c8e706fda801afdb3cf63bb994b41009.avif?t=1773856859\" width=720 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of the game, the underlying narrative will begin to show itself. <strong>There is more to these kids than initially seems</strong>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1773856859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1773856859 width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>InkForge Studios </strong>is supporting<strong> Great Ormond Street Hospital Charity (GOSH Charity) </strong>by donating<strong> 25% </strong>of the game\u2019s<strong> Steam revenue!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InkForge Studios Creative Director, <strong>Thomas Hunt</strong>, is a outpatient at GOSH. From the <strong>age of just 2 weeks old</strong>, Tom had to undergo an operation and has been a <strong>patient there ever since</strong>. This was what initially fueled our desire to develop our previous title, 'I'll be Brave, Tomorrow' in partnership with GOSH, and the same is true for 'Fireside Fables'!</p></li></ul>","developers":["InkForge Studios"],"dlc":[4502830,4506610],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/e2af8aa5c999917e4fa2312754e255dae3c0b2b9/header.jpg?t=1773856859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365560/612936876/72771b9c7df336c822097fb327ab9f2ad38d2cf6/1773830409/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773831249","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365560/612936876/72771b9c7df336c822097fb327ab9f2ad38d2cf6/1773830409/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773831249","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365560/612936876/72771b9c7df336c822097fb327ab9f2ad38d2cf6/1773830409/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773831249","id":257305322,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257305322/a2c61b2c81f36552d2b94480e55fdb